import{_ as t,o as e,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const y=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 858 | Transcended Ones and History | Historical Construction of the Symbiotic Civilization","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 858 | Transcended Ones and History | Historical Construction of the Symbiotic Civilization","no":858,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Symbiotic History","Chronicle","Anchor-Awakening Era","Historical Narrative"],"related":["72-Anchor-Awakening Era","77-Establishment of Myriad-Rank Republicanism","93-Chronicle Brief Table","848-Epic Creation"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0858_模块4-超脱者与历史-共生文明历史建构.md","filePath":"en/0858_模块4-超脱者与历史-共生文明历史建构.md"}'),a={name:"en/0858_模块4-超脱者与历史-共生文明历史建构.md"};function r(s,i,l,c,d,h){return e(),n("div",null,[...i[0]||(i[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-858-transcended-ones-and-history-historical-construction-of-the-symbiotic-civilization" tabindex="-1">Entry 858 | Transcended Ones and History | Historical Construction of the Symbiotic Civilization <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-858-transcended-ones-and-history-historical-construction-of-the-symbiotic-civilization" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 858 | Transcended Ones and History | Historical Construction of the Symbiotic Civilization&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 72, 77, 93, 848</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-symbiosis-did-not-fall-from-the-sky-it-was-walked-out-step-by-step" tabindex="-1">Introduction: symbiosis did not fall from the sky; it was walked out step by step <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-symbiosis-did-not-fall-from-the-sky-it-was-walked-out-step-by-step" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: symbiosis did not fall from the sky; it was walked out step by step&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old worldview&#39;s history is &quot;the protagonist&#39;s accidental rise story&quot; — one day the protagonist opens a cheat, and from then on the world is turned upside down. The symbiotic civilization is not this way. It is Myriad Ranks step by step, generation after generation, crawling out of predation&#39;s ruins, slowly building up. This entry explains: how the transcended one constructs this real journey into a &quot;symbiotic-civilization history&quot; — it is not myth, but a queryable, credible, generation-passing public memory.</p><p>Six top-level axioms centrally fulfill <strong>the republican axiom of Myriad Races</strong>: history&#39;s subject is Myriad Ranks; <strong>the anti-predation axiom</strong> requires history record predation&#39;s end; <strong>the collective ascension axiom</strong> requires history present upward direction; <strong>the causal self-discipline axiom</strong> requires history be true not fictional; <strong>the law-first axiom</strong> requires the chronicle be self-consistent and correspondable to laws.</p><p>Among them, <strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong> is the sixth pillar: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. The old cosmos&#39; resources and Great Dao are limited, necessarily leading to predatory involution; the Anchor Symbiotic everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-several-key-eras-of-symbiotic-civilization-history" tabindex="-1">I. Several Key Eras of Symbiotic-Civilization History <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-several-key-eras-of-symbiotic-civilization-history" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Several Key Eras of Symbiotic-Civilization History&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Documents 70 and 93 sketch the symbiotic civilization&#39;s historical skeleton; the transcended one does deep construction on it:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Era</th><th>Core Event</th><th>Historical Significance</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Pre-Anchor Era</td><td>Long darkness of predatory cultivation</td><td>Lesson: why we cannot go back</td></tr><tr><td>Anchor-Awakening Era</td><td>Anchor born, symbiosis sprouts</td><td>Symbiosis&#39; starting point</td></tr><tr><td>Symbiosis-System Establishment Period</td><td>Three-hundred systems open, institutions take shape</td><td>Symbiosis lands</td></tr><tr><td>Myriad-Rank Republicanism Established</td><td>Each clan equal and republican</td><td>Myriad-Rank 99% coverage fulfilled</td></tr><tr><td>Cross-Plane / Hyper-Multiverse Era</td><td>Cross-cosmos anchors, Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm</td><td>Toward infinite uplift</td></tr></tbody></table><p>This timeline tells Myriad Ranks: we did not live in a paradise from the start; we walked out of darkness. <strong>This &quot;walking out&quot; process is the symbiotic civilization&#39;s most precious heritage.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-historical-construction-s-principle-truth-above-beautification" tabindex="-1">II. Historical Construction&#39;s Principle: Truth Above Beautification <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-historical-construction-s-principle-truth-above-beautification" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Historical Construction&#39;s Principle: Truth Above Beautification&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Constructing symbiotic-civilization history is not equal to &quot;writing a beautified history.&quot; The transcended one insists:</p><ul><li><strong>Do not evade darkness</strong>: the Pre-Anchor Era&#39;s predation, sacrifice, and regression are faithfully recorded;</li><li><strong>Do not deify heroes</strong>: record key contributors, but place them within the &quot;Myriad Ranks jointly build&quot; framework;</li><li><strong>Do not omit struggle</strong>: civilization is not a smooth road; record roads taken wrong, pits stepped on;</li><li><strong>Align with laws</strong>: every key node in the chronicle has a corresponding explanation at the law layer and causal layer.</li></ul><p>Truth is historical construction&#39;s first principle — because entry 848 said epics must be based on truth; entry 856 said history must serve early warning. A beautified history neither educates Myriad Ranks nor early-warns regression.</p><h2 id="iii-historical-construction-s-products" tabindex="-1">III. Historical Construction&#39;s Products <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-historical-construction-s-products" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Historical Construction&#39;s Products&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one constructs history into several reusable public products:</p><ul><li><strong>Chronicle</strong>: objective record, for scholars and supervisors to check;</li><li><strong>Epic</strong> (entry 848): cast historical facts into singable narrative, shaping identity;</li><li><strong>History textbooks</strong>: educate Myriad Ranks (entry 838), letting the next generation know where they came from;</li><li><strong>Early-warning model</strong>: distill regression signals from historical laws (entry 857).</li></ul><p>One history, simultaneously archive, textbook, art, and early-warning device — it lives in the present, not lies in a museum.</p><h2 id="iv-historical-construction-and-myriad-rank-participation" tabindex="-1">IV. Historical Construction and Myriad-Rank Participation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-historical-construction-and-myriad-rank-participation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Historical Construction and Myriad-Rank Participation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The symbiotic civilization&#39;s history may not be written by the transcended one alone. It is jointly constructed by Myriad Ranks:</p><ul><li>Each clan contributes its own oral history and clan memory;</li><li>The chronicle is open to each clan for revision and supplementation;</li><li>Myriad Ranks have a joint say on &quot;who we are, where we came from.&quot;</li></ul><p>This is the historical dimension&#39;s Myriad-Rank republicanism — <strong>history is not the strong ones&#39; family tree, but Myriad Ranks&#39; joint autobiography.</strong></p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: deposit Myriad Ranks&#39; real co-building journey into reusable public memory, avoiding repeated exploration</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: history faithfully records predation&#39;s end and price, writing anti-predation into civilization&#39;s genes</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo history is the protagonist&#39;s cheat-using rise story; the Heng Yuan Zhou history is Myriad Ranks&#39; republican history step-by-step walking out of darkness</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: each clan participates in writing its own history, not represented for</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: chronicle, era division, and history textbooks all public, queryable and correctable by Myriad Ranks</li></ul><h2 id="supplement-historical-construction-s-publicity-and-weight" tabindex="-1">Supplement: Historical Construction&#39;s Publicity and Weight <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplement-historical-construction-s-publicity-and-weight" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplement: Historical Construction&#39;s Publicity and Weight&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Constructing history may not be written by the transcended one alone. Each clan contributes oral history; Myriad Ranks participate in revision and supplementation; the whole process is public under Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision: what happened in which year, whose contribution was recorded, whether any clan was omitted, all queryable. The transcended one&#39;s work presiding over historical construction is counted into civilizational weight by its effect of being &quot;true, comprehensive, and inspiring to Myriad Ranks.&quot; When the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&#39;s history is Myriad Ranks&#39; jointly written, queryable, credible autobiography, it is simultaneously archive, textbook, and early-warning device — living in the present, not lying in a museum.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The symbiotic civilization&#39;s historical construction turns &quot;how symbiosis came to be&quot; from vague legend into a queryable, credible, usable public memory. It does not beautify, deify, or omit struggle; it faithfully records how Myriad Ranks walked step by step out of predation&#39;s ruins. When every generation of beings knows &quot;where we came from, what we walked through, why we cannot turn back,&quot; symbiosis is no longer institution, but a civilization identity with historical depth. This is the most precious spiritual heritage the transcended one leaves Myriad Ranks.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/72-锚点觉醒纪元.html">Entry 72 · Anchor-Awakening Era</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/77-万族共和成立.html">Entry 77 · Establishment of Myriad-Rank Republicanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/93-编年史简表.html">Entry 93 · Chronicle Brief Table</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/848_模块4-超脱者与艺术-史诗创作.html">Entry 848 · Epic Creation</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const p=t(a,[["render",r]]);export{y as __pageData,p as default};
